2 CONT Image Group Number: 008345999
2 CONT
2 CONT Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/45401946/john-gustin: accessed July 23, 2026), memorial page for John Gustin (15 Nov 1762–1821), Find a Grave Memorial ID 45401946, citing Vittoria Baptist Cem
2 CONC etery, Vittoria, Norfolk County, Ontario, Canada; Maintained by Joseph R. Klett (contributor 47554493).
2 CONT
