1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles was born in Apr./May 1789, probably in Bertie Twp., Welland Co., Ontario (then Upper Canada). He was the son of John Gustin and Abigail Smith. He married first to Ann "Nancy" Sovereen. He married second to 
2 CONC Mary Underhill.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had the following children by his first wife:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Abigail (1816-1852) m. Isaac Hadcock--linked below; 2. Patience (poss. d. bef. 1852), m. Daniel Ryan; 3. Elizabeth "Betsy" Mary (1818-1840) m. Jacob Sovereen--linked below; 4. Angeline (1823-1913);
2 CONT
2 CONT He had the following children by his second wife:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Amelia (1832-1881) m. George Hall--linked below; 6. Charles Broadman (abt. 1837-1887) m. Doroty Canty; 7. Martha Jane (1839-1887) m. Amos Thompson; 8. John A. (1845-1931) m. Ellen Matilda Barber--linked below; 9. Eliphalet Clar
2 CONC k (1847-1928) m. Susan Hester Hubbard--linked below.
