1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rachel was the daughter of John Gustin and Abigail Smith. She was named in her father's will in the year 1800, and is thought to be one of the 5 children he had before 1795. The 1793 birth year shown above was adde
2 CONC d by the creator of this memorial, the late Tom Hoot, and is probably speculative.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel reportedly died young, unmarried. However, reference is apparently also made in The Commemorative and Biographical Record of Lambton County to John Gustin's daughter "Rachel, who married Samuel York, and died leaving no chi
2 CONC ldren."
2 CONT
2 CONT Further information about her would be greatly appreciated. Note: Heartfelt thanks to Tom Hoot for creating this memorial.
