1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jemima was bequeathed a share of lands in her father's will in 1800 (filed 1821). She married Israel Wood Jr. on 29 Jan. 1806.
2 CONT
2 CONT With her siblings, she signed off on the remainder of her father's lands to her brother Eliphalet in 1823. She was living in Charlotteville Twp., Norfolk Co. at that time.
2 CONT
