1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Pembertons of Massachusetts and those of Pennsylvania, as well as Roger Williams, the founder of Rhode Island, are related and related also to the Pembertons of Lancashire, but the exact relationship is now unk
2 CONC nown. Some believe that James Pemberton, the immigrant to New England, was a son of John and Catherine (Angell) Pemberton of London, who were married on January 21, 1609, but the evidence is not conclusive.
