2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth:	December 25, 1775 in White Creek, Albany, New York, United States
2 CONT * Death:	October 25, 1854 (78) in Carolina Mills, Richmond, Washington County, Rhode Island, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT * The Sabbath Recorder", Vol 11, No 22, p 87, Nov. 9, 1854. At Carolina Mills, R. I., on the 25th Oct., Dr. Hazard Wilcox, in the 77th year of his age. He has long been known as a man of skill in his profession, and much lamented 
2 CONC in the community as well a large number of relatives and friends, who mourn his passing. J. G.
2 CONT
