2 CONC eb%26gsfn_x%3d0%26gsln%3dPierson%26gsln_x%3d0%26MSAV%3d1%26uidh%3dyd5&ssrc=&backlabel=ReturnSearchResults&rc=2095,826,2307,883;2290,829,2558,887 link] to Charles Smith and Rachel Amy Bryant: Their ancestors and descendants Links
