1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isaac Newton Seela met Zelda May Ridgill while he was visiting his uncle, William Seela, and she was visiting her aunt, Mary Ellen Dawson, in Englevale, Crawford County, Kansas. They married there on August 4, 1895
2 CONC .  Four children were born in Kansas.  They moved to Jasper County, Missouri in 1905, living at the location that has the current address 11589 County Road 80.  Their fifth child was born there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac and Zelda and the parents of a daughter-in-law, Edna Luella (Holdeman) Seela, bought adjacent lots in Fasken Cemetery.  Relationships are shown on the genealogy marker located next to Zelda's marker.* Reference: [https://www
