1 NOTE {geni:about_me} O'NEILL, Florence:
2 CONT
2 CONT Writer and musical composer; born in
2 CONT
2 CONT Pittsburgh, Jan. 22, 1868; son of Daniel O'Neill. After attending public schools he completed his education at Phillips Academv, Andover. Mass. He married, in Pittsburgh, in 1888, Elizabeth McKay. He has written considerably over 
2 CONC the pen name of "Dick Dasher" : is one of the proprietors of the Pittsburgh Dispatch, and is also a composer of songs and instrumental music. Address : Corner Penn and Linden Avenues, Pittsburgh.
