1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birth==
2 CONT Oliver Dennis Mabee was born on August 31, 1817 in Ontario, Canada. He was the son of Simon Mabee and Abigail (Gustin) Mabee.
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Oliver Dennis Mabee was married twice.
2 CONT # Oliver Dennis Mabee and Samantha (Barber) Mabee married around 1836.
2 CONT # Oliver Dennis Mabee and Mary Ward married.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT Oliver Dennis Mabee and Samantha (Barber) Mabee
2 CONT # Abigail Mabee
2 CONT # Aaron Mabee
2 CONT # Elizabeth Barber Mabee
2 CONT Oliver Dennis Mabee and Mary Ward
2 CONT # Charles Byron Mabee
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Oliver Dennis Mabee passed away in 1896 in Monteagle, Marion, Tennessee. He was buried in Monteagle Cemetery, Monteagle, Marion County, Tennessee.[2]
2 CONT ==Research==
2 CONT The Mabee House in Monteagle in Marion County, Tennessee - built near original homestead of Dr. Oliver Mabee [3] [4]
