1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birth==
2 CONT Elizabeth (Mabee) Burtch was born on January 24, 1800 in Ontario, Canada. She was the daughter of Simon Mabee and Abigail (Gustin) Mabee.
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Absalom Burtch and Elizabeth (Mabee) Burtch married in 1819 at Oxford County, Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT Absalom Burtch and Elizabeth (Mabee) Burtch had 8 children.
2 CONT # Jane Burtch (1820 - )
2 CONT # Clarissa Burtch (29 Mar 1820- 5 Dec 1894)
2 CONT # Mary Annie Burtch (20 Sep 1823 - 3 Dec 1924)
2 CONT # Wentworth Simeon Burtch (@1827)
2 CONT # Almon Washington Burtch (@1828)
2 CONT # Samuel Burtch (@1837 - 30 May 1875)
2 CONT # Abigail Arena Burtch (23 Dec 1838 - 31 Jan 1918)
2 CONT # Ida Burtch c(@1841 - 31 Jan 1918).
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Elizabeth (Mabee) Burtch was 84 when she passed away on December 4, 1884 at Aylmer, Elgin County, Ontario, Canada. She was buried at Ingersoll Rural Cemetery, Ingersoll, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT ==Sources==
