2 CONT Mr. E. H. Gustin, one of London's well known residents passed away about 4 o'clock Saturday morning.  He was born in Lobo Township over 71 years ago and had been a resident of London since 1879.  Mr. Gustin is survived by his wife
2 CONC , four sons and two daughters
