1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward L Monaghan was a native of Ireland. The last name appeared as "Moneghan" in some records. He married first Harriet Seeley who died in 1826. James, their only child, was then taken - or stayed in Chemung Coun
2 CONC ty to live with his relatives. James would have been about two years old. More information about Harriet's family can be found at http://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=bcmonah1&id=I023
