1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Orange County Surrogate Court Records:  Book F, Page 114 - Administration Document dated 1 Dec 1830 shows Deborah Seely, Albert's widow, and her father, David Roe as a friend of Albert, as Administrators of the "goods, chattels an
2 CONC d credits" of Albert Seely.   William D. Welch has a copy of this document.
2 CONT
2 CONT Orange County Surrogate Court Records:  Book B, Pages 191, 192, and 193 -- Guardianship Documents dated 16 Jul 1831 shows that Deborah Seely is the mother and Albert Seely was the father of David Roe Seely, Ruth Seely and Clarissa
2 CONC  Seely.   These documents were filed after his death.  William D. Welch has copies of these documents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert Seely and Deborah Roe are shown on page 696 of the Strong Family Genealogy as the parents of David Roe Seely, Ruth Seely, and Clarissa Seely.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is listed in the Seeley Genealogical Society Seventh Generation Families (SGS Vol. III) as #1746 on Page 75.
