2 FORM jpg
2 _PRIM Y
1 NOTE Came to America by way of Barbadoes, sailing from Endland, Feb. 22, 1678, in "Bachelor's Delight"; was in Lewes, Sussex Co., on the Delaware,in the same year, and where his wife and son, James, joined him in 1681; was Clerk of the
2 CONC  Courts of Sussex Co., on the Delaware, now State ofDelaware, May 12, 1683; and member of Assembly for the Province of Pa., from that county, Dec. 3, 1686; d. in 1688.
1 NOTE @N6000000001169461686@
