1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ezekiel Harris was born on September 20, 1756, in Bedford, New York to parents Ezekiel and Martha Harris. Ezekiel served several enlistments under different commands, 1775-81, New York Militia. He married Elizabeth
2 CONC  Mercer Hamilton on June 29, 1782, in New York. They had 15 children in 30 years. He died on June 26, 1837, in his hometown, having lived a long life of 80 years.
