2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:  Susan Groome, Marriage: 1817 Madison, Monroe, Missouri, who died in Missouri. Their children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *(1) '''William Lowry'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *(2) '''Sarah Lowry,''' married George Peacock April 4, 1840.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000014138904396?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000081568054828 '''Married (2) Children with Mary Wilcox, married on 1 Feb. 1824 in Shelby, Tennessee.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''James Hazard Lowry''' b. June 3, 1825, m. Mary Ann Bryerly
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Hyrum Lowry''' b. March 15, 1827, d. March 16, 1847
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''John Jr. Lowry''' b. Jan. 31, 1829, m. Sarah Jane Brown, m. Mary A. Allen
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Abner Lowry''' b. Oct. 12, 1831, m. Louisa Bradley
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Susan Lucretia Lowry''' b. March 13, 1834 (d. Oct. 21, 1859), m. William George Pettey Dec. 13, 1854
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Mary Artemesia Lowry''' b. March 13, 1834, m. George Peacock Aug. 5, 1854
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''George Moroni Lowry''' b. Aug. 9, 1836, d. May 26, 1856
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sarah Jane Lowry''' b. Jan. 26, 1838, m. Nelson D. Higgins
