2 CONT =Married (3) Anna Maria Johnston, Marriage: 13 Feb 1853, in Manti, Sanpete, Utah & (4) and Elizabeth Crompton=
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://history.churchofjesuschrist.org/missionary/individual/john-lowry-1799?lang=eng Photo of John Lowry & Missionary History from the Missionary Database, from the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter Day Saints]
2 CONT
2 CONT =Places Lived=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Move:	1832, Lewis, Missouri, United States
2 CONT * Move:	1838, Jackson, Missouri, United States
2 CONT * Move:	1840, Lee, Iowa, United States
2 CONT * Move:	From 1840 To 1846, Nauvoo, Hancock, Illinois, United States
2 CONT * Endowment (LDS) Dec 24 1845
2 CONT * Departure: June 21 1847, Winter Quarters, Elkhorn River, Nebraska Territory, (USA)
2 CONT * Arrival: Sep 29 1847, Great Salt Lake Valley, Utah Territory, (USA)
2 CONT * Residence:	Manti, Sanpete, Utah, United States 1850 - 1867
2 CONT * Military Service: Nov 1 1865, Utah, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://history.lds.org/missionary/individual/john-lowry-1799?langeng Biography of John Lowry Sr. - The following history was written by a grandson]
2 CONT
2 CONT The records on the microfilm "Crossing the Plains" shows family of eight, John, Mary and children John, Jr., Abner, Susan L., Mary A., George, and Sarah Jane. 1847, Members of Capt. Edward Hunter's Hundred part of which arrived in
2 CONC  G. S. L. Valley 29 Sep 1847.
2 CONT
2 CONT In “Pioneer Immigrants to Utah Territory" it states that John was born in Springfield, Robinson, Tennessee to William Lowry and Polly Norris. His spouses were Susan Groome, Mary Wilcox, Anna Maria Johnston and Elizabeth Crompton. 
2 CONC  He traveled to Utah with his family and others including Justus Azel Seeley and his large family.  Some of the places they settled before coming to Utah were:  Madison, Marion, Clay and Caldwell Counties in Missouri, Lee County, 
2 CONC Iowa, Nauvoo, Hancock, Illinois and finally Manti, Sanpete, Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Deloras Lowry Middleton states that John Lowry married also Anna Maria Johnson, no issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000078109755998& Complete History of John Lowry Sr.]
2 CONT
