2 CONT James Married Mary Ann (Bryerly) in Manti, Sanpete, Utah. After her death in 1866, Mr. James H. Lowry remarried in 1869 to Delia Luttrell, the marriage taking place at Volcano.  On April 18, 1882, Mr. and Mrs. James Lowry welcomed
2 CONC  a new daughter into their family, she being born at Aqueduct City.
2 CONT
2 CONT James Hazard Lowry was a native of Madison County, Missouri, the son of John Lowry and Mary Wilcox.   (Submitting family member lives in Willows, California.)
2 CONT
2 CONT To read about the Pioneer cemetery where James is buried go to this link; it's worth your while.
