1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Abner Lowry, Sr.=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Big Ydna Results, I-BY19889, - Scotch Irish'''
2 CONT * Source:  Y-DNA of Abner Lowry is I-BY53629 (from FamilyTreeDNA test (FTDNA)). This Y-DNA was tested by Michael Lowry, great-great-grandson of Abner Lowry, being a descendant through Abner's son John Hyrum.  The second Y-DNA test
2 CONC  mentioned here (I-FT209324) is from Sims Wendel Lowry, a second cousin to Michael Lowry.  Common ancestor between Michael Lowry and Sims Wendel Lowry is Abner Lowry.  The Y-DNA test of Sims Wendel Lowry was later updated by FTDNA
2 CONC  to I-BY53629 after Michael Lowry took his test but it has not been updated on Geni.  I-BY53629 is a newer branch from the older branch of I-FT209324.  Going back further on the Y haplotree is I-BY19889, an even older branch. -Col
2 CONC leen Lowry, sister of Michael Lowry
2 CONT * Son of John Lowry, Sr. and Mary Anne Wilcox 
2 CONT * Birth: Oct. 12, 1831 in Palmyra, Marion, MO, United States
2 CONT * He was rebaptized on 5 December 1853 while living in the Manti, Utah ward.
2 CONT * His initial trip to the Valley in 1847 is mentioned in his sister's obituary. Several years later, he captained his own company in 1866. 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000014139764585?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000147079011033 '''Obituary in Manti Messenger, date 1900-12-22 in Local and other News''']
2 CONT * Death:	December 17, 1900 (69) in Freedom, UT, United States
2 CONT * Place of Burial: Manti Cemetery in Sanpete County Utah, USA Plot: Lot 17 Block 12 Plat A Grave 1
2 CONT * [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=33486653 '''Created by: Vauna Mri Record added: Feb 02, 2009, Find A Grave Memorial# 33486653''']
