1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (son of Justus Wellington Seely and Clarissa Jane Wilcox) born February 20, 1843, Nashville, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Hannah Olsen July 24, 1863. Mt. Pleasant, Utah (daughter of Hans Olsen and Chasty Okersen of Sweden, pioneers October 20, 1867). She was born November 27, 1842.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Emma Jane born October 30, 1864, married Christian Grice Larsen;
2 CONT             Hanna born September 19, 1866, married Nad Olsen;
2 CONT             Orange born December 29, 1869, married Trena Hansen;
2 CONT             Sarah born February 7, 1871, married Samuel H. Larsen;
2 CONT             Chasty born June 9, 1873, married Heber Frandsen;
2 CONT             Henry Alonzo born December 2, 1875;
2 CONT             Mary Bertrude born April 3, 1878;
2 CONT             Ethel Ingre born September 16, 1880, died;
2 CONT             David Randolph born January 16, 1882, married Elva Singleton.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family home Castledale, Utah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bishop of North ward, Mt. Pleasant, 1877-79; also bishop of Castle Valley ward 1879-83. First counselor to President C. G. Larsen 18 years. President of town board two terms. Member legislature 1894. Sources:	
2 CONT
