1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Seely family initially arrived in Utah in 1847, and then in 1851 were sent to San Bernardino, California. Mary Miranda Seely was born in San Bernardino, California.  In 1857 they were called back to Utah becaus
2 CONC e of the threat of Johnston's Army and arrived in Utah in 1858. They settled in Mt. Pleasant, Utah in 1859. Further research is needed to determine the name of the company they traveled with.  
