2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Benjamin Franklin Wilbour,LITTLE COMPTON FAMILIES; Little Compton Historical Society; p 708; FH L film #0844901. ................................................. Timothy Closson, s/o Josiah & Mary (Williamson) Closson b. 
2 CONC 5 Jan 1680/1, Marshfield, MA, d. ca 1706, Little Compton, RI; m. 16 Jun 1702 Martha Wilbore, dau/o Joseph & Ann (Brownell) Wilbore, b. 20 Aug 1684; m2 24 Oct 1707, Thomas Burgess, who m2 1721, Patience (-?-) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Timothy & Martha (Wilbore) Closson had 2 chn: Josiah, b. 1 Oct 1703; Timothy, b. 5 Jul 1705; mentioned in will of grfa Joseph Wilbore 11 Jan 1727/8 [3]
