2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p57.htm#i1697
2 CONT *''''''Sarah Tuttle
2 CONT *''''''F, d. 17 November 1676
2 CONT *Father William Tuttle d. Jun 1673 
2 CONT *Mother Elizabeth Matthews d. 30 Dec 1684 
2 CONT *''''''     Sarah Tuttle was christened at New Haven, New Haven, CT. She married John Slauson on 22 November 1663 at New Haven, New Haven, CT. Sarah Tuttle died on 17 November 1676; Murdered.
2 CONT *''''''Family John Slauson b. c 1641, d. 1706 
