1 NOTE Info from internet says; Sarah Tuttle, fined by the New Haven, Ct. court for
2 CONT flirting with a married man, her brother Benjamin later murdered her with an
2 CONT axe.
2 CONT Dorothy Hall (adhall-so.windsor@worldnet.att.net) is descendent of Sarah.
