2 CONT # Mary Elizabeth Slawson born 21 Apr 1680 in Stamford, Fairfield Co., Connecticut. She married Joseph Slawson Dec 1707 in Stamford, Fairfield County, Conn born 1680 in Bedford, Westchester Co., New York. Notes for Mary Elizabeth S
2 CONC lawson: Mary was Josiah's second cousin, daughter of John and Elisabeth (Bendict) Slawson. They settled in Bedford, but apparently had no children. 
