2 NOTE The lady standing to the right of our grandfather is Lida C Totten who is your great grandmother  in other words grandfather Kingery"s mother.  Seated on the left is grandma Kingery and on her lap my father on his christening day.
3 CONC   The lady seated on the right is Armenia Totten your great great grandmother  , she is the mother of Lida.    She does not appear in our tree here as I took our tree back only with direct decendents of John Alden and she is not o
