1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Idaho Post, June 3, 1921:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Mary Westover, was born in Ontario, Canada, and passed away at her home in Moscow, Wednesday evening [June 1] at 11:30 o'clock, age 80 years, 7 months and 23 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband, R.M. Westover passed away in Moscow about one year ago.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Westover has lived in Moscow the past 16 years. She is survived by five sons, S.F. and T.N. Westover who live in the east, G.W. Westover of Bellingham, Washington; N.J. Westover of Kendrick, Idaho and B.W. Westover of Moscow 
2 CONC and by one daughter, Mrs. O.E. Johnston of Moscow. Four of her children have preceded her to their eternal home.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral arrangements will not be made till the sons in the east are heard from.
