1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birth==
2 CONT Levi was born about 1795, the son of Zachariah Burtch and Jane (Babbitt) Burtch.
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Levi Burtch and Anna (Mabee) Burtch married around 1822.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT Levi Burtch and Anna (Mabee) Burtch, apparently, had no children.
2 CONT ==Occupation==
2 CONT Levi Burtch was a farmer.
2 CONT ==Religion==
2 CONT Levi Burtch was Baptist.
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Levi Burtch passed away on July 27, 1881 in West Oxford Township, Oxford, Ontario, Canada at the age 86. The informant was his nephew, Zachariah Sage. He was buried in Ingersoll Rural Cemetery, Ingersoll, Oxford County Municipalit
2 CONC y, Ontario, Canada.
