1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT Absalom Burtch
2 CONT ==Birth==
2 CONT Absalom Burtch was born on January 18, 1793 in Beekman, Dutchess County, New York. He was the son of Edee Burtch and Catherine (Becker) Burtch.
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT In 1819, Absalom Burtch married Elizabeth (Mabee) Burtch.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT # Jane Burtch (1820 - )
2 CONT # Clarissa Burtch (29 Mar 1820- 5 Dec 1894)
2 CONT # Mary Annie Burtch (20 Sep 1823 - 3 Dec 1924)
2 CONT # Wentworth Simeon Burtch (@1827)
2 CONT # Almon Washington Burtch (@1828)
2 CONT # Samuel Burtch (@1837 - 30 May 1875)
2 CONT # Abigail Arena Burtch (23 Dec 1838 - 31 Jan 1918)
2 CONT # Ida Burtch c(@1841 - 31 Jan 1918). 
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Absalom Burtch passed away at the age of 78 on May 30, 1871 in Woodstock, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada. He was buried in Ingersoll Rural Cemetery, Ingersoll, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT ==Sources==
