1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 246.  William Hoffman Seeley b. c. 1832 first appeared on the 1853 assessment list of Wells Township,    Bradford County, Pennsylvania as Huffman Seeley and the same in 1854 operating a business with    brother in 
2 CONC law Humphrey Wilson. On the 1856 assessment list he was listed as “W. H. Seeley” and    assessed for one pair of oxen. He last appears on the 1857 assessment list, d. Wisconsin.
