1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Deborah Roe married Joseph Belcher.  She is shown in Joseph Belcher's will dated 30 Aug 1874 .  She is also shown in the will of her father, David Roe,  which is dated  23 Jun 1852.   The following is shown on page 121:  I give an
2 CONC d bequeath to my daughter Deborah wife of Joseph Belcher the sum of five hundred dollars  . . . etc.  The wills are on file in the records of the Orange County, New York Surrogate Court.  Deborah also left a will dated 7 Oct 1876.
2 CONC   William D. Welch has copies of these wills.
