1 NAME Daniel Corwin /Weed/
2 GIVN Daniel Corwin
2 _MARNM Weed
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Oakdale Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Wilton
3 STAE Iowa
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 JUN 1816
