1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ASAHEL KING / 1781 - 1868
2 CONT
2 CONT Eldest child of Paul King II (1761 - 1810) and Hannah (Pitts) King (1768 - 1840).  Asahel King was born on September 23, 1781 in Chesterfield (Hampshire County), Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Asahel King married first
2 CONT
2 CONT Asahel King migrated from New York to Michigan in 1837 and 'took up many acres of land in and around Rives Township, Section 16, fromthe government on 31 May 1842".
2 CONT
2 CONT Asahel King passed away, aged 86, on April 4, 1868 in Rives Junction (Jackson County), Michigan.  Asahel King is interred at the Cole Cemetery in Rives Junction, Michigan.  Additionally interred at the Cole Cemetery are -- 1.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Interment data per Find A Grave Memorial #
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
