2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-382555261-1-500261/nathaniel-seeley-sr-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 19 2017, 5:03
