2 CONT Robert and Mary HEATH were married 15 Dec 1626 at London, England. She was b. 1589/90 in England and d. 1630 in England. Robert immigrated to America, apparently after her death. Robert and Mary MANNING were married 22 Dec 1666 at
2 CONC  Huntington, Long Island, NY. She was b. 1620 in England and d. in NY. Her father was William MANNING. I'd guess Robert met his second wife in NY. The CASTLE family gedcom shows Robert's b. in 1600.
