2 CONT Daughter of Balthasar Mercer. Sister of Elizabeth Mercer Lucae and Margaret Elizabeth Mercer Uckerman. Married James Claypoole, 12-Dec-1657, Bremen, Bremen, Germany. Rev. Conradus Lelius, Calvin minister, presiding. She is the mot
2 CONC her of John Claypoole, Mary Claypoole Cooke, Helena Claypoole Bethell, James Claypoole, Sr., Prissilla Claypoole Crappe, Nathaniel Claypoole, Josiah Claypoole, Samuel Claypoole, Nathaniel 2nd Claypoole, [--?--] Claypoole, George C
2 CONC laypoole, Joseph Claypoole, Joseph Claypoole and Elizabeth Claypoole. They arrived in America 6-August-1683 aboard the ship Concord as prominent Quakers. She is my gggggggg-grandmother. 
