1 NOTE After Sarah Shepard Claypool died, leaving a large family, Jeremiah married Mary Davock Russell sometime before Jeremiah wrote his will in 1744.  The will,dated Dec. 10, 1744 and probated May 9, 1745, named his children:
2 CONT Comfort Conwell; George Claypoole, Jehu Claypoole; Joseph Claypoole; Mary Fowler; Sarah Gum; Rachel Conwell; Elizabeth Claypoole; and an unborn infant.
2 CONT
2 CONT Most of the birth and death dates, plus the listing of George Claypooleand double listing of John Claypoole, came from the LDS Ancestral File.  The parents of Sarah Sheppard also came from the Ancestral File.  The birth and death 
2 CONC date for Jeremiah Claypoole came from and Ancestral File record which lists him as married to Mary Durock, born 1679 in Lewes, Sussex Co., Delaware, and married 10 May 1710.  Another record listsJeremiah married to Sarah Sheppart 
2 CONC on 10 Mar 1730, with her dying two years later in May 1732.
