1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Parents seen as Helena Mercer & James Claypoole, and also as Norton Claypoole & Rachel.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Claypool-86
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Claypoole was born to Norton Claypoole and Rachel in Lewes, Delaware on 16 May 1687.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT "Elizabeth, daugher of Norton and Rachell Claypoole, was born at Lewis [Lewes], Delaware, 16 3rd mo. 1687 about 7 P.M. 'in the presence of Thomas Wynne and Elizabeth his wife, ye midwife, & Jane Maud, her daughter, Hannah Bailey' 
2 CONC and several other women."[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth is listed on the Internet as the daughter of James Claypoole. She is actually the daughter of James' brother, Norton Claypoole and was born in Delaware.[1] James Claypoole had a daughter Elizabeth but she died as an infa
2 CONC nt.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Disputed origins
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: James CLAYPOOLE Helena MERCER
2 CONT '''
2 CONT *Find A Grave as of July 31, 2024 says parents are James Poole 1664-1706 and Mary Steelman (Cann) 1660-1705 are her parents and James Claypoole and Helena Mercer are his parents.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Claypoole married William Pettyjohn in 1713 in Sussex County, Delaware.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. William Pettyjohn 1716 - Aug 1799 married Ruth Scarborough bef 1749. 
2 CONT * 2. Levinia Pettyjohn 1718-  
2 CONT * 3. Esther Pettyjohn 1720 - 1803 married Absolom Littell in 1745 in DE, died in PA. 
2 CONT * 4. Agatha Pettyjohn 1721-  
2 CONT * 5. Sarah Pettyjohn 1772-  
2 CONT * 6. Mary Pettyjohn 1724-
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
