1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==John Lowry, III==
2 CONT
2 CONT The above photo shows some of John's children--Back row: Olive Lowry Snow, Sarah Jane Lowry Leslie, John Lawrence Lowry; Front row: Harold Bertsen Lowry, Rozella Lowry Harmon, Frederick Irven Lowry.
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN LOWRY, JR. was a farmer and wool grower. When he reached the age of 15 he engaged for several years in hauling produce to the mining camps of Utah and Nevada, and then took up160 acres of land south of Manti, where he raised 
2 CONC mostly hay and kept from40 to 50 head of stock. He was also interested in wool growing with his brother, William B., and they owned over 3000 head of sheep. He was also a stockholder in the Central Utah Wool Co., the Messenger Pri
2 CONC nting Co., president of the North Six-Mile Creek Irrigation Co., and secretary and treasurer of the Pioneer Water Co. He was a policeman for about fourteen years. City Marshal a number of years and Constable.
2 CONT
2 CONT He built a nice residence in town. Mr. Lowry was one of the substantial men of Manti and an honor-able and upright citizen. He married March 13, 1870, Heneretta, daughter of William and Henrietta Anderson, who was also born in Man
2 CONC ti, September 12, 1855. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Parents:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * John Lowry 1829 - 1915 & Sarah Jane Brown Lowry 1834 - 1920
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Married:==
2 CONT
2 CONT Heneretta Laurentza Anderson Lowry 1855 - 1928
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * John Lawrence Lowry 1877 - 1954
2 CONT * Kenneth Lowry 1879 - 1879
2 CONT * William Andersen Lowry 1880 - 1880
2 CONT * Harold Bertsen Lowry 1882 - 1906
2 CONT * Irvin Frederick Lowry 1884 - 1936
2 CONT * Fredrick Irven Lowry 1884 - 1936
2 CONT * Sarah Jane Lowry Leslie 1885 - 1963
2 CONT * Henretta Laurentze Lowry Nelson 1887 - 1982
2 CONT *Olive Lowry Snow 1888 - 1968
2 CONT * Rozella Lowry Harmon 1891 - 1978
2 CONT * Eva Lowry 1897 - 1897
2 CONT * Clifton Andersen Lowry 1900 - 1908
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Dawnetta Record added: Sep 29, 2009 Find A Grave Memorial# 42527782
2 CONT
