1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married: Isaac Bruno on 22 Sep 1871 of Moroni, Sanpete, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan Louisa was born April 29, 1859 in Manti, Sanpete, Utah and died October 27, 1929, in Manti, Sanpete, Utah. She was the daughter of Abner Lowry and Betsy Louisa Bradley. She married Isaac Bruno September 22, 1874. They were t
2 CONC he parents of 6 children: the first child weighed 16 lbs and the birth was so difficult the child was stillborn, Lydia, George Washington, Mary Malinda, Clara Francell, and Hettie C. In the Moroni,1910 census Susan Louisa states t
2 CONC hat “she has had 6 children and only 2 are living.” Also listed is an Allen M. as one of their children, but none of the family ever mentioned him, as they did all of the others, so we assume that he was probably the child who was
2 CONC  stillborn, or possibly a relative who was living with them in 1910.
2 CONT
