2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Brigham J. Peacock who is buried in the Emery Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Cathy Peacock, #47447639:
2 CONT
2 CONT "There seems to be conflicting information out there for the exact birthday of Daniel Movell Peacock. I have been reading through George Peacock's Journal and he writes that on April 1st he left for Salt Lake to attend the Legisla
2 CONC ture. While he was gone his wife Mary gave birth to a son. Most people have it in March on different days, but it seems to have happened the first week in April."
2 CONT
2 CONT "The family has his death date as November 14, 1895, but his grave marker reads1896. The following was found in the Manti Messenger. PUBLISHED IN MANTI MESSENGER, November 22, 1895:
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Word was received here the first of this week announcing the death of Movel Peacock over in Castle Valley. The young man was a former resident of Sterling.' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT George Daniel Peacock 1822 - 1878
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Artimesia Lowry Peacock 1834 - 1910
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Movelle Peacock 1895 - 1896
2 CONT
2 CONT  Created by: Paul Hodel Record added: Mar 16, 2009 Find A Grave Memorial# 34889432
