1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/139681/catherine-matilda-wilcox Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 13 2021, 17:44:58 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Catherine Matilda Westwood Wilcox, 80, of Mt. Pleasant, died Saturday night at her home after a long illness.
2 CONT She was born March 19, 1860, at Springville, a daughter of Richard Webley and Catherine Dallin Westwood, pioneer Utahns. Mrs. Wilcox had resided in Mt. Pleasant since 1869.
2 CONT
2 CONT Salt lake Tribune July 23, 1940
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Richard Westwood and Catherine Dallin
2 CONT Married to Hazzard Willcox
2 CONT COD: Chronic myocarditis
2 CONT
2 CONT Death certificate State of Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT Cemetery records are under Wilcox
2 CONT
2 CONT ∼Mother was Cathrine Pallin and Father was Richard Westwood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://history.utah.gov/burials/execute/viewburial?id=866&cemeteryid=SP1600
