1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mrs. Kate Evelyn Schofield, 77, of Spring City, died Wednesday morning at the Sanpete LDS Hospital of natural causes.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Mt. Pleasant Dec. 4, 1885, a daughter of Hazard and Matilda Westwood Wilcox. Married to Charles N. Nay, at Mt. Pleasant in 1902. He died in 1909. She later married William Schofield in 1932. He died a few years later. She 
2 CONC was a member of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.
2 CONT
2 CONT Salt Lake Tribune May 17, 1963.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
