2 CONT Martha Wilbore (daughter of Joseph Wilbore and Anna Brownell) was born 20 Aug 1684 in Little Compton, Newport County, Rhode Island, and died Dec 1746 in Little Compton, Newport County, Rhode Island.She married Thomas Burgess on 24
2 CONC  Oct 1707 in Little Compton, Newport County, Rhode Island, son of Thomas Burgess and Lydia Gaunt.
