1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bull-141 WikiTree Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 24 2017, 4:19:07 UTC''
