1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT Ancestry Family Tree  http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=103920662&pid=4118
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ABIGAIL BULL (BUEHL)
2 CONT She was married to ABRAHAM PALMER on 24 Dec 1747 in NINE PARTNERS, DUTCHESS CO., NEW YORK. THE MARRIAGE IS RECORDED IN THE MINUTES OF OBLONG MONTHLY MEETING, SOCIETY OF FRIENDS, VOL. 1149. ABRAHAM AND SOME OF HIS SONS LEFT NINE PA
2 CONC RTNERS AND WENT TO CATSKILL OR COXSACKIE, ALBANY CO., NEW YORK ABOUT 1775. HE IS LISTED , ALONG WITH NOAH, JACOB, SOLOMON AND STEPHEN PALMER IN THE 11TH REGIMENT OF THE CONTINENTAL AMERICAN ARMY OF ALBANY CO., NEW YORK. THERE IS N
2 CONC O FURTHER RECORD OF ABRAHAM OR JACOB, SO THEY MAY HAVE BEEN KILLED IN THE REVOLUTIONARY WAR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT THERE IS NO PRIMARY EVIDENCE OR RECORD OF THE CHILDREN OF ABRAHAM AND ABIGAIL BUT SECONDARY EVIDENCE IS QUITE DEFINITE AND HAS BEEN ACCEPTED BY THE LDS GENEAOLOGICAL LIBRARY THAT THE FOLLOWING ARE THEIR CHILDREN: ABRAHAM, EBENEZER
2 CONC , DAVID, NOAH, ABIGAIL, ISAAC AND DARIUS. THESE HAVE BEEN SEALED TO ABRAHAM AND ABIGAIL. THEY MAY ALSO HAVE HAD A SON SOLOMON BUT THIS IS NOT VERIFIED. Children were: ABRAHAM PALMER, EBENEZER PALMER, DAVID PALMER, NOAH PALMER, ABA
2 CONC GAIL PALMER, RACHEL PALMER, ISAAC PALMER, DARIUS PALMER, SOLOMON PALMER.
