2 DATE 27 JAN 1873
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nicholville
3 STAE New York
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Joseph was the 4th child of Caleb and Freelove Mitchell Olin. He was known as "Deacon" as to membership in the Baptist Church. He was married to Hulda Smith on Jun 15, 1806 in Addison, Vermont.  She died in Feb. 1831 in Canton, Ne
2 CONC w York and he married 2nd to Hepsibath "Seba" Andrews in 1832 in Lawrenceville, New York. If anyone is interested in extending these lines, please contact me,  Ruth
