1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Warwick Nove. 24---William Augustus Onderdork died at his home at Edenville on Nov. 21 at the age of 73 years. Deceased was the father of Mrs. Ann Ayres, of Bradford, N.Y.; Rena E. Onderdork, of Florida; Mrs. Georg
2 CONC e W Tutes, of Vernon, N. J.; Mrs Blace J Brink, of Sussex, N. J.; and Jennie B Onderdork, of Amity. Their mother died several years ago. The funeral was held at 1 o'clock Friday at the Edenville M. E. Church.
