2 CONT
2 CONT Susan was the daughter of Israel Miller and Susan Cornelia (Totten) Miller. She born in Fort Wayne, IN, on 31 July 1869. Susan lived in Fort Wayne until she was nine years old, when she moved with her family to Grundy County, TN. 
2 CONC When she was 14 years old, the family moved to Litchfield, MN, where she attended high school and then taught several terms in Swift and Meeker Counties. Susan married Charles (Chas) Ernest Phelps on 16 Oct 1890 in Litchfield. The
2 CONC y immediately took up residence in Minneapolis, MN. Susan died on 17 May 1951 in Hennepin, Minnesota. She and Chas had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT •	Ethelwyn (Affie) Phelps  m. R.P. Hannaher
2 CONT •	William Miller Phelps m. Vera A. Mitchell
2 CONT •	Anna Louise Phelps m. Eugene Scriver 
2 CONT •	Charles Pratt Phelps m1. Della Bloom m2. Katherine Kent
2 CONT •	Fred Totten Phelps m. Dorothea Kurtzman
2 CONT •	Dorothy May Phelps 
