1 CONT Remarks: Hannum, John. Concord, yeoman. July 13, 1730. February 8, 1730/1. A.328. Provides for wife Margery. To daughter Mary wife of Thos. Smith £10. To daughter Elizabeth wife of Thomas Broom £10. To daughter Margary wife of Ant
